# World of Warcraft: Forever, 1.60.1. The interface number is the wiki's
# for the beta (DECKUIFOREVER_BERICHT.md, section 2); /df build compares it
# with the running client. One .toc per addon - Forever is the one game.
#
# DeckUI's hub files, retail branch, minus what Forever does not have:
# talkinghead.lua (no Blizzard_TalkingHeadUI), questbook.lua and meter.lua
# (Mists-only), lfgqueue.lua (Forever's group finder is the Vanilla-style
# one), charpanel/mail/restock.lua (Mists helpers, to be looked at later).
